@host = http://localhost:5225

### Generator status
GET {{host}}/status

### Pause / resume live generation
POST {{host}}/generator/stop
###
POST {{host}}/generator/start

### Available incident scenarios
GET {{host}}/scenarios

### Inject an incident right now (durationSeconds is optional)
POST {{host}}/incidents/AuthenticationFailure?durationSeconds=120&distractors=2

### Inject a cascading failure (watch it spread over ~2 minutes)
POST {{host}}/incidents/NotificationBackpressure?durationSeconds=120

### End the active incident early
POST {{host}}/incidents/resolve

### Ground truth for all incidents (do NOT give this to the investigator)
GET {{host}}/incidents

### Search logs (all filters optional)
GET {{host}}/logs?service=PaymentService&minLevel=Warning&take=50

### Everything for one order
GET {{host}}/logs?orderId=ORD-150000

### Free-text search in message / exception
GET {{host}}/logs?q=timeout&from=2026-09-26T10:00:00Z&to=2026-09-26T11:00:00Z

### Live stream (Server-Sent Events)
GET {{host}}/logs/stream?minLevel=Error

### Metrics
GET {{host}}/metrics?service=PaymentService&metric=db_connections_active&take=30

### Generate an offline dataset with ground truth
POST {{host}}/datasets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "eval-20",
  "durationMinutes": 120,
  "incidents": 20,
  "minUsers": 30,
  "maxUsers": 60,
  "seed": 42,
  "includePromptInjection": true,
  "distractors": 1
}
